68 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (Data quality & scope: The dataset is broad but uneven in depth. The most important discovery was that 90% of movies have no average rating, because the Letterboxd community's rating history only extends back reliably to the late 1990s.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
