70 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 182 0 R
/E (Drama dominates, but the landscape is rich. Drama accounts for 232K genre tags, followed by Documentary \(164K\) and Comedy \(141K\). Because each movie can carry multiple genre tags, the real story is in the combinations and how they shift over time and across geographies.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
